    "design": [
      "resources are finite and concrete",
      "every spend may foreclose other actions",
      "opportunity cost is receipted explicitly",
      "meeting one demand does not erase residual demand",
      "people are not fungible resource units",
      "discipleship is formation/apprenticeship, not ownership of labor",
      "culture emerges from repeated attributable choices rather than a morality score",
      "prayer and rest recharge by spending finite time"
    ]
  },
